{
 "total": 90.852,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "l01",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "problem",
   "show": "Claude! I built a website, but the design looks terrible. And I don't even know if everything works!",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 5.615
  },
  {
   "id": "l02",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "arrive",
   "show": "Hey, don't worry! Anthropic has Agent Skills that can help with exactly that.",
   "start": 5.835,
   "end": 10.507
  },
  {
   "id": "l03",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "what",
   "show": "Skills? What do they actually do?",
   "start": 10.727,
   "end": 12.551
  },
  {
   "id": "l04",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "what",
   "show": "They're reusable instructions and tools that teach me how to handle specific tasks, like designing websites, testing apps, and creating new workflows.",
   "start": 12.771,
   "end": 22.354
  },
  {
   "id": "l05",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "design",
   "show": "For your design problem, we can use the frontend-design skill. I ran it on your page. New fonts, colors and layout. It even fixed a bug: your order buttons updated an element that doesn't exist.",
   "start": 22.574,
   "end": 34.604
  },
  {
   "id": "l06",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "design",
   "show": "Wait... that looks so much better!",
   "start": 35.624,
   "end": 37.235
  },
  {
   "id": "l07",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "testing",
   "show": "But how do I know the website actually works?",
   "start": 37.455,
   "end": 40.059
  },
  {
   "id": "l08",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "testing",
   "show": "That's where webapp-testing helps. We can check interactions and find problems before you publish. I ran 13 checks. 9 passed. 4 failed: the email box accepts broken addresses like just an @ sign.",
   "start": 40.279,
   "end": 53.761
  },
  {
   "id": "l09",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "testing",
   "show": "Skills don't make a site perfect, but they help me catch problems early.",
   "start": 53.981,
   "end": 58.136
  },
  {
   "id": "l10",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "install",
   "show": "Okay, I need these skills! How do I install them?",
   "start": 58.856,
   "end": 61.96
  },
  {
   "id": "l11",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "install",
   "show": "Open Claude Code, add Anthropic's official skill marketplace, then install the example-skills plugin.",
   "start": 62.18,
   "end": 68.826
  },
  {
   "id": "l11b",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "install",
   "show": "That's it. frontend-design, webapp-testing and skill-creator are now ready to use.",
   "start": 69.246,
   "end": 74.34
  },
  {
   "id": "l12",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "final",
   "show": "So instead of explaining everything from scratch, I can use the right skill for the job?",
   "start": 75.06,
   "end": 80.409
  },
  {
   "id": "l13",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "final",
   "show": "Exactly. And you can create your own reusable skills too!",
   "start": 80.629,
   "end": 83.899
  },
  {
   "id": "l14",
   "who": "A",
   "scene": "end",
   "show": "Now that's useful!",
   "start": 84.819,
   "end": 85.927
  },
  {
   "id": "l15",
   "who": "C",
   "scene": "end",
   "show": "Try the official Anthropic skills and see what you can build.",
   "start": 86.147,
   "end": 89.832
  }
 ],
